# Provisional application of the fishing agreement between the EEC and Seychelles.

This scope calculates the duration of the provisional application period for the fishing agreement.

```catala
declaration scope ProvisionalApplication:
  input initial_agreement_date content date
  input provisional_start_date content date
  input entry_into_force_date content date
  input payment_deadline content date
  output provisional_duration content duration
```

The duration of the provisional application is calculated by finding the difference between the entry into force date and the provisional start date.

```catala
scope ProvisionalApplication:
  date round down
  definition provisional_duration equals
    entry_into_force_date - provisional_start_date
```